{"v":4,"catch":"摧毀所有敵人的UFO！ ！","desc":"《Juno FIRST》是 KONAMI 於 1983 年推出的射擊遊戲。\n操作自己的飛機擊敗無數逼近的敵方UFO，征服WAVE。\n在緊急情況下，你可以使用扭曲來躲避敵人的攻擊。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-03-13","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9999fedd98d1f6f10d4ee6133913038b316f8fb1da49e57748cf5ad1f3af8ee5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/34698ceb0c67d25eea5117d7d2b18c5e1c9a804e403c8e6e107518153165239a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a74aaf7c74f4785d86608cc6deaebc6383b90bf059981e045744d4a53956630e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a56d108215dcc8dde99e6583b02c00752bd60c9002b813e6da2fd2d7a4a89ff2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7f4aa64f04953d8fb1ffea37719ee6d0cc4a752384eb1d4236a42d1a2b9e5f4c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3158f32da7cfbeccdb96fae93bc5fd6af96ce67785466afb49869535e2aeb889.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f2c02142a000","dlc":[]}